  "description": "meme-id: apparently_not_erdogan; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a grotesque, emaciated humanoid figure resembling a goblin or orc from fantasy media, holding a fish, with the overlaid text 'apparently not erdogan'. The intent is to use a dehumanizing and monstrous visual metaphor to disparage Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdoğan, implying he is not human or is monstrous. This is a hateful meme that attacks Erdoğan based on his identity as a political figure, using racist and dehumanizing imagery (comparing him to a non-human creature) to convey contempt and ridicule. The visual metaphor maps the grotesque figure onto Erdoğan, suggesting he is 'not human' or 'monstrous', which is a form of hate speech targeting a specific political leader based on his identity and perceived characteristics. The meme is designed to provoke negative sentiment and reinforce prejudice against Erdoğan, fitting the definition of hateful content.",
